+ * numeric keys compare by value, strings by UTF-16 code unit order (so "B" comes before "a"; it is not
+ * locale-aware). Items whose key is undefined, null, NaN or an invalid Date go last, in their original
+ * order. keyFn is called once per item, with the item only.
