+ * the position is p / 100 * (n - 1) counted from 0, and a fractional position blends its two neighbours:
+ * percentile([15, 20, 35, 40, 50], 40) is 29. An empty array gives NaN, and so does an array containing
+ * NaN. Infinities sort as the extremes; blending -Infinity with Infinity gives NaN, as in median. Large
